[{"title":"湖居秋日病起","author":"释智圆","text":"旧识稀相访，寥寥掩坏房。\n鼎深残药在，颔瘦白髭长。\n尘点沾书箧，苔痕污石床。\n檐幽虫织网，砌冷菊含香。\n静思怜深夜，清羸怯晚凉。\n云峰归未得，闲坐咏沧浪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19862,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖居感伤","author":"释智圆","text":"迷真渺无始，飘业产钱唐。\n外族宗南郡，门风祖偃王。\n微缘先劫种，宿习妙龄彰。\n父母怜多病，亲宾怪异常。\n布花模讲道，画石学题章。\n戒印龀年佩，心猿志学狂。\n荣名虚准拟，簪组妄思量。\n礼乐师周孔，虚无学老庄。\n躁嫌成器晚，心竞寸阴忙。\n翼翼修天爵，孜孜耻面墙。\n内藏儒志气，外假佛衣裳。\n每恶销金口，时劳疾恶肠。\n手中期得桂，箭下待穿肠。\n騃鹿方随燄，坚冰忽遇阳。\n系珠知在体，甘露忝亲尝。\n要道传三观，真机得妙常。\n不然心迹火，任结鬓根霜。\n觉路双轮驾，真空两翅翔。\n饥来还遇膳，渴去已逢浆。\n静处如来室，高眠解脱床。\n理高山峭拔，道大海汪洋。\n力战魔军散，功扶佛化昌。\n空山怜寂寂，尘路笑茫茫。\n触境知无著，闲居贵坐忘。\n消摇希自了，言说亦何妨。\n撰疏松窗冷，挥松古殿凉。\n来蒙随力化，真诰应机扬。\n达理虽云短，寻文或有长。\n圆伊令了悟，法爱教消亡。\n性任融凡圣，修宜示否臧。\n冥心潜应梦，取验敢垂祥。\n事佛身多累，为师道实荒。\n衡门连竹石，草屋带林塘。\n冬服和絺绤，中餐乏稻粱。\n水边云作伴，岩下柏为香。\n景物看无厌，幽栖兴未央。\n晚篱啼翡翠，春沼浴鸳鸯。\n菡萏花如画，嵚崟岫若妆。\n飘窗松韵淡，翻砌菊花黄。\n放鹤时登岭，观鱼或在梁。\n岂愁身病害，长喜世平康。\n无处求烦恼，随时任寂光。\n昏衢悬慧日，苦海泛慈航。\n誓坐菩提树，高跻寂灭场。\n冥真周法界，垂应遍诸方。\n顿渐门皆邃，偏圆药尽良。\n惊迷辩雷震，摧惑法轮彊。\n鹫岭先开会，金河后秘藏。\n留形归后德，遗法益无疆。\n四等心弥广，三慈化甚详。\n道齐诸妙觉，事类释迦皇。\n生灭非吾土，圆澄是故乡。\n一空长寂寂，万类本惶惶。\n庶了无生旨，无生更可伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19863,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答行简上人书","author":"释智圆","text":"偶依溪上居，三见改时候。\n来书问踪迹，行坐置怀袖。\n学道不加前，多慵还似旧。\n苦吟彻宵夜，闲眠消白昼。\n古屋荒莓苔，幽庭下猿狖。\n巧伪非吾好，直方自大授。\n侯门绝请谒，雅诰勤研究。\n悠悠皆面朋，谁能论去就。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19864,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慎交歌","author":"释智圆","text":"莫言青松青，有时亦摧折。\n莫言圆月明，有时亦亏缺。\n莫逆论心素，刎颈定交结。\n年发未及衰，交情已消歇。\n俄因竞分寸，忽尔成楚越。\n爱之欲其生，恶之欲其死。\n识欲松枯及月亏，请看陈馀与张耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19865,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昭君辞","author":"释智圆","text":"昭君停车泪暂止，为把功名奏天子。\n静得胡尘唯妾身，汉家文武合羞死。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19866,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鉴","author":"释智圆","text":"佳人磨拭频，常恐尘埃侵。\n皎皎夜月明，澄澄秋泉深。\n徒分妍丑容，不鉴是非心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19867,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暮秋书斋述怀寄守能师","author":"释智圆","text":"杜门无俗交，尘事任浩浩。\n空斋学佛外，六经恣论讨。\n仁义志不移，贫病谁相恼。\n天命唯我乐，百神非吾祷。\n为文宗孔孟，开谈黜庄老。\n谀谄音声恶，寂寥滋味好。\n褰帷愁绪绝，凭栏寒气早。\n雁影沈远空，虫鸣咽衰草。\n伊余何为者，力拟行正道。\n愿扬君子风，浇浮一除扫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19868,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酷热","author":"释智圆","text":"酷热如小人，到处苦相侵。\n清风如君子，时来宽我心。\n酷热驱不去，清风留不住。\n此情无以诉，吟傍阴阴树。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19869,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潜夫咏","author":"释智圆","text":"有叟匿姓名，自号为潜夫。\n潜身在云泉，潜心入虚无。\n身心俱已潜，质直反若谕。\n智者谓之智，愚者谓之愚。\n愚智自彼异，潜夫未曾殊。\n陶陶乐天和，任性何曾拘。\n宗儒述孟轲，好道注阴符。\n虚堂踞高台，往往谈浮图。\n漫衍虽无家，大方贵无隅。\n俗人每侧目，订之为狂徒。\n素隐而行怪，执政宜先诛。\n天公既保全，幸得存微躯。\n冲雪登高山，乘月泛平湖。\n性灵敌云闲，形骸类松枯。\n何以免饥寒，认得衣中珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19870,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题石壁山绍上人观风亭","author":"释智圆","text":"界江千万山，石壁惟清幽。\n中有忘机人，超然乐岩丘。\n创亭号观风，嘉景自成收。\n群峰呈晚碧，长溪泻寒流。\n视听足怡情，万事安能求。\n尝言徂暑天，登时疑清秋。\n云容既冷淡，松韵还飕飗。\n扰扰九衢尘，谁知高静游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19871,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠头陀僧","author":"释智圆","text":"上行唯知足，时人岂易同。\n一身依树下，万虑尽禅中。\n乞食村飘雪，降眠月坠空。\n应悲浮世上，烦恼事无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19872,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠诗僧保暹师","author":"释智圆","text":"天文悬日月，地文丽山川。\n人文粲六经，四术诗其先。\n仲尼既云删，炳然列风雅。\n厥旨幽且微，受之唯子夏。\n邈矣千百年，时有知诗者。\n卓尔保暹师，生于宋天下。\n内明卜商道，外减骚人价。\n凿彼淳粹源，清辞竞流泻。\n放意尚幽远，立言忌妖虫。\n旨哉天目集，四海争传写。\n上以裨王化，下以正人伦。\n驱邪俾归正，驱浇使还淳。\n天未丧斯文，清风千古振。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19873,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠赵璞","author":"释智圆","text":"世态任悠悠，正人无谄求。\n古柏凌寒霜，皓月当高秋。\n心将周孔师，日远杨墨游。\n泾浊与渭清，由来自分流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19874,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠简上人诗","author":"释智圆","text":"常人隐林泉，反为名利萦。\n志士处阛阓，杳有江湖情。\n有客务高洁，禅房闭重城。\n闲门无俗迹，坏壁饶虫声。\n卧落春砌花，吟尽霜蟾明。\n道希君子知，贫任时人轻。\n秉操期不渝，长保孤松贞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19875,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有客","author":"释智圆","text":"有客有客，来扣我门。\n相见无言，自昼达昏。\n支肘凭栏，俯仰乾坤。\n百年瞬息，得丧谁论。\n远山青青，巨浸浑浑。\n忽然归去，目击道存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19876,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其十","author":"释智深","text":"清波无透路，转处少人知。\n斫却月中桂，清光付与谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19877,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其九","author":"释智深","text":"笑里凭谁眼豁开，龟毛须向火中栽。\n脚跟有路云泥隔，千里区区谩往来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19878,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其八","author":"释智深","text":"好手呈机不露锋，惯将双剑定雌雄。\n忽雷迸出惊天地，华岳三峰倒卓空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19879,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其七","author":"释智深","text":"兴化逐克宾，观音戴鬼面。\n靴里动指头，未免傍人见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19880,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其六","author":"释智深","text":"庵主拳头举处亲，赵州话鲁指西秦。\n知音不在千杯酒，一盏空茶也醉人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其五","author":"释智深","text":"崔颢曾题黄鹤楼，上头春色少人游。\n清香已逐残春去，无限狂蜂恋不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其十二","author":"释智深","text":"新妇快骑驴，阿家引鞭走。\n石笋夜抽条，面南看北斗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19883,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其十一","author":"释智深","text":"古木灵巢鹤梦迷，昆崙白象倒骑归。\n鱼鳞水涨舟横岸，羊角风生花落溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19884,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其四","author":"释智深","text":"裴公悟处绝譊讹，尺水能翻万丈波。\n霹雳机中反活眼，锋铓句里罢干戈。\n峰头路，暂经过。\n浓绿万枝红一点，动人春色不须多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19885,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其三","author":"释智深","text":"古渡无风下直钩，丝纶意在得鲸鳌。\n马师言下扬家丑，千古儿孙草里游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19886,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其二","author":"释智深","text":"吹毛剑首乾坤黑，臂堕山河掩日光。\n群起须弥头倒卓，方知两两不成双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19887,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十二首 其一","author":"释智深","text":"末后无端重漏泄，焦齿翁翁嚼生铁。\n玉鞭击碎月明珠，累及儿孙扬丑拙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19888,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释智深","text":"兜率降生，双林示灭。\n掘地讨天，虚空钉橛。\n四十九年，播土扬尘。\n三百馀会，纳尽败缺。\n尽力布网张罗，未免唤龟作鳖。\n末后拘尸城畔，椁示双趺。\n旁人冷眼，看来大似弄巧成拙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19889,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辞众偈","author":"释智策","text":"四大既分飞，烟云任意归。\n秋天霜夜月，万里转光辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19890,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释智策","text":"著意忘怀，掘地深埋。\n空洞无象，髑髅妄想。\n譬如两镜相照，中间早已立象。\n直饶东涧水流西涧水，南山烧炭北山红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19891,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马祖接石巩赞","author":"释智愚","text":"草枯山欲冷，逗晓入重云。\n一箭无双中，何如射一群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19892,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丹霞遇庞公赞","author":"释智愚","text":"邂逅漉篱翁，言谈耳又聋。\n不知何处去，破帽裹西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19893,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天龙恭敬赞","author":"释智愚","text":"云散千峰晓，神龙应念来。\n补陀岩上士，心识几时灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19894,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太白兴禅师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"泯迹深藏一坞云，仙官何事苦相亲。\n修行不是无灵验，懒作关门闲户人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19895,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"支遁和尚归休图赞","author":"释智愚","text":"忍寒骑瘦马，双眼碧于秋。\n寄语王公道，无钱买沃洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19896,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼龙牙遁禅师塔","author":"释智愚","text":"翠微际北腕头短，洞水逆流方到家。\n年老脚跟宜著袜，不能随处蹈泥沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19897,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼明招谦禅师塔","author":"释智愚","text":"藤深蔓短塔累累，以眼名龙恐是伊。\n放下泥盘叉手笑，阿师曾误矮阇梨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19898,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼牧护和尚定身塔","author":"释智愚","text":"牧牧纯来岁月多，至今壳漏未消磨。\n莫嫌截断苏溪水，尚有禅岩挂绿萝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19899,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗庵主赞","author":"释智愚","text":"袈裟裹草鞋，赤脚桐城走。\n只者破生涯，抵死扬家丑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19900,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郁山主赞","author":"释智愚","text":"略彴蹈翻天地黑，盲驴恶拗弄蹄行。\n从兹不到茶川上，溪水自涵山影清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19901,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郁山主赞","author":"释智愚","text":"日暖跨驴出，溪桥款步行。\n因思遭攧处，寸草不曾生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19902,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金沙赞","author":"释智愚","text":"琅琅流水声，怀抱尽情倾。\n不识春风面，雪消梅影清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19903,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鱼篮赞","author":"释智愚","text":"顾顾不释手，提起复低头。\n自笑无人买，腥风吹未休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19904,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南岳修首座赞","author":"释智愚","text":"云雾充饥腹，烟霞补破衣。\n祝融峰顶寺，几度对斜晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19905,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"神光参达磨赞","author":"释智愚","text":"石禅寒到骨，松雪照清眸。\n此道如山重，难将一臂酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19906,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渡芦赞","author":"释智愚","text":"江空芦叶冷，风静衲衣轻。\n不得梁天子，无人知姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19907,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离雪山像赞","author":"释智愚","text":"弊衣缠瘦骨，衰发覆苍颜。\n世上底时节，刚然要出山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19908,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十五首 其二十五","author":"释智愚","text":"敛影穷原懒出扃，晓云如送又如迎。\n因思执手经行处，几听沙泉绕涧鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19909,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十五首 其五","author":"释智愚","text":"天晴盖却屋，乘时刈却禾。\n输纳皇租了，鼓腹唱讴歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19910,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十五首 其九","author":"释智愚","text":"流虹七载夤缘尽，又向天宁理倩窠。\n脱得驴胎入马腹，皮毛轻重不争多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19911,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十四首 其十一","author":"释智愚","text":"去时晓露消袢暑，归日秋声满夕阳。\n恩渥重重何以报，望无云处祝天长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19912,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其十三","author":"释智愚","text":"日日日东上，日日日西沉。\n无为无事者，子细好推寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19913,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上竺柏庭月法师画像赞","author":"释智愚","text":"厚重如山，宽大如海。\n丹青有神，莫拟其踪。\n僧繇笔妙，难状其迹。\n如上国之春归，香风四吹。\n如银蟾之出水，万象敛影。\n是为三教融通，大法之宗主者也。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19914,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大慧禅师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"前无释迦，后无达磨。\n骂雨骂风，祇要做大。\n黑漆竹篦胡打乱打，是佛是魔劈面便唾，因兹天降其咎。\n衡阳梅阳，十七年吞饥忍饿。\n将谓万里生还知非，元来一星子不曾改过。\n者般瞎秃得人憎，天上人间无两个。\n咄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19915,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丰干骑虎赞","author":"释智愚","text":"万德不将来，猛兽自驯伏。\n一啸出林，阴风拔木。\n只知拊掌放憨，不觉山青水绿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19916,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云门大师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"掉发睦州，脱赚灵树。\n赤体露金风，清波无透路。\n阿师脚跛不能行，休对乾峰南岳去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19917,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五祖演和尚赞","author":"释智愚","text":"师之道兮不可得而称，师之德兮不可得而述。\n师之行兮不可得而闻，师之业兮不可得而见。\n道德行业，闻见称述，世人昭昭然若其。\n荷佛祖慧命于将仆之际，转凡夫于贤圣之域。\n是谓之东山老人，吾不得而知焉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19918,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无补侍者请赞","author":"释智愚","text":"计较拙于鸠，轩昂老而虎。\n闻必意消，见者难睹，到头不识宾中主。\n黑漆竹篦劈面挥，师资谁谓无裨补。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19919,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无准和尚禅者请赞仍侍立赞","author":"释智愚","text":"移圆就方则辛，抑方为圆则苦。\n枘凿不相入，是无准门户。\n五峰峨峨兮等观，万象拨拨兮谁睹。\n霜降水落，子归就父。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19920,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无隐侍者请赞","author":"释智愚","text":"斗斗㖃㖃，雷驱电驰。\n垂手未游象外，虚空突出毫釐。\n目前难遏密，冷落有谁知。\n父攘羊，子證之，从教万古黑风吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19921,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水石赞","author":"释智愚","text":"非水石可凭，非音声所及。\n花笑鸟啼，圆通證入。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19922,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出山古像赞","author":"释智愚","text":"金钟夜击九重城，六载归来改瘦形。\n待得众生心眼活，雪山依旧碧崚嶒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19923,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对月了经赞","author":"释智愚","text":"欲要了，无可了。\n山头月，圆又缺。\n只好罢休看，夜深风露寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19924,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"布袋和尚赞 其一","author":"释智愚","text":"一肩驼不起，两脚走如飞。\n业风交辊笑嘻嘻，问渠是谁渠不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19925,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"本立藏主请赞","author":"释智愚","text":"春山万叠，秋水一痕。\n凛然风彩，何处求真。\n大方出没兮全生全杀，丛林悱悱兮独角一麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19926,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玄沙和尚赞","author":"释智愚","text":"不出飞猿，皮下有血。\n钓鱼放生，死中得活。\n讥雪峰用力太过，笑灵云根底未彻。\n只知意在钩头，不觉眼中著屑。\n阿呵呵，谁辨别。\n万顷烟波，一钩新月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19927,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉泉普明法师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"金石丝竹难以类乎声，碧云清风难以同其调。\n玉光幽洁，花信融通。\n妙在有无外，岂堕空假中。\n张生伏笔，何处形容。\n此是适庵老子之常准，肯与能诗能画者同。\n藉藉流芳灵苑寺，眇然千古仰高踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19928,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]